  "label": "User projected onto the proud Dodge Ram truck owner",
  "description": "The user is projected onto the visual material of the man standing beside his Dodge Ram truck, as the meme humorously implies that 'dodge owners be like' — meaning the user (or viewer) is imagining themselves as a proud Dodge owner who doesn't want to be photographed. The projection is onto the visual entity 'man: Dodge Ram truck owner', who embodies the stereotype being described. The text 'dodge owners be like' acts as a deictic cue directing the user to identify with the depicted owner.",
